  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safety Review of the existing St Helena Bulk Fuel Installation (BFI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Foreign, Commonwealth and Development Office and the Saint Helena Government are seeking a suitably qualified supplier to produce a condition assessment and process hazard analysis of the ageing bulk fuel installation on the UK overseas territory of St Helena. The objective of this work is to undertake condition surveys and hazard analysis to ensure the Bulk Fuel Installation can continue to be safely operated until St Helena&#x2019;s new fuel facilities are in service.</narrative>
  </description>
